int_anchor  @e3d487c4
  why   A def that takes a registry is compiled for the registry it is called
        with; with no call site at all it would not compile. This def gives
        each such driver one.
  entry the compiler, which types each registry driver from this call when
        a program uses the module without calling it; never run
  x    a placeholder array for every argument
  rep  a report vector
  out  a place for the check drivers' consensus
  a    the ERI driver's result
  b    the J/K driver's result
  v    the check drivers' verdicts, added
